From: Huawei <@huawei.com>
Date: Tue, 26 Nov 2024 15:19:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] net/meson: add support for hinic3 DPDK pmd driver

Add support for hinic3 DPDK pmd driver to driver/net/meson.build.

Signed-off-by: Huawei <@huawei.com>
---
 drivers/net/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/meson.build b/drivers/net/meson.build
index 29f4777..75ac89b 100644
--- a/drivers/net/meson.build
+++ b/drivers/net/meson.build
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ drivers = ['af_packet',
 	'failsafe',
 	'fm10k', 'i40e',
 	'hinic',
+	'hinic3',
 	'hns3',
 	'iavf',
 	'ice',
